Source: runway
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Cedric Hombourger <chombourger@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson (>= 1.0), ninja-build, pkgconf, libssl-dev, libfuse3-dev, gnu-efi, qemu-user-static <cross>
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: runway-tools
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Runway boot store control and audit tools
 Includes rwyctl for managing slots and states in Runway boot stores,
 fsck.runway for integrity auditing, and the RUNWAY.EFI boot loader.

Package: runway-fuse
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fuse3, runway-tools (>= ${source:Version})
Description: FUSE filesystem driver for Runway boot stores
 Provides the rwy-fuse daemon and the boot.mount systemd unit to mount
 a Runway boot store as a BLS-compliant /boot filesystem.

Package: runway-bls
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, runway-fuse (>= ${source:Version}), systemd-boot | systemd (<< 252)
Description: Boot Loader Specification integration for Runway
 Configures kernel-install, systemd-bless-boot, and interactive shells
 to work with Runway synthetic BLS boot stores.
